      "Status": "Registered",
      "SummaryOfActivities": "The Company's continuing objective is to perform the highest standard of symphonic music to enrich and contribute to the cultural and artistic life of all South Australians. It performs mainly in South Australia and held 85 performances to an audience of greater than 83,000. It also performed with The State Opera of South Australia, The Adelaide Festival of the Arts and the Australian Ballet.",
